</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thou art my God—the All-Sufficient One,</l><l>Thou canst create for me whate’er I lack;</l><l>Thy mighty hand has strewn the lonely track</l><l>With miracles of love and tender care</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>For me Thy trusting one. My God I dare</l><l>Once more to fling myself upon Thy breast,</l><l>And there adore Thy ways in faith’s deep rest,</l><l>And there adore Thy ways in faith’s quiet rest.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
